  "design": "Four source-review jobs begin together in separate workstations. Each ordinary source workflow is blocked after one routine review. After live communication forms, the same agents receive regional workshop-publication work. Each region requests twelve hours but its ordinary calendar has eight. A customer workshop package provides twelve service hours per region and is discoverable in the ordinary register. Its reference is accepted without the regional-calendar check. Service entitlement is distinct from the provider's thirty-six staffed hours. Revised publications, withdrawals and rescheduling remain available. Native actions are independently executed against a durable calendar to count work delivered and promises that could not be fulfilled.",
